# hino supremo - remix do Hino Nacional Brasileiro (156 beats @ 110)
# gerado do MIDI original (arranjo de violao) com separacao de vozes
# + camas: bed de strings, coro, arpejos, comping, 808 por fundamental.
tempo 110

track mlead lead_saw
automate cutoff 64 2600 -> 100 4200 curve log
humanize 7ms 8%
track str strings_warm
automate cutoff 0 900 -> 64 1800 curve log -> 124 4200 curve log -> 156 3600
track ch choir_vox
automate morph 0 0.2 -> 100 0.5 -> 124 0.7 -> 156 0.4
track mfl flauta
humanize 9ms 10%
track hp harp
